{"seq":1,"slug":"on-computable-numbers","title":"《论可计算数》","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/alan-turing/major-works/on-computable-numbers","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-1936-paper","title":"一九三六年的论文","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/alan-turing/major-works/on-computable-numbers/the-1936-paper","wordCount":2137,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-birth-of-the-turing-machine","title":"图灵机的诞生","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/alan-turing/major-works/on-computable-numbers/the-birth-of-the-turing-machine","wordCount":1923,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 《论可计算数》\n\n本章呈现图灵一九三六年的论文《论可计算数》。这篇划时代的论文，提出了\"图灵机\"，奠定了现代计算机科学的理论基础，是二十世纪最重要的科学论文之一。两篇文档，分别呈现一九三六年的论文，以及图灵机的诞生。\n"}